            <div class="col-lg-6">
              <h2 class="mb-4">Why is Finance Decentralized (DeFi)?</h2>
              <p>In centralized finance, your money is held by third parties who facilitate money
                movement between
                other parties, with each of these facilitators charging fees for their services.Decentralized finance
                eliminates intermediaries and service fees by allowing people to conduct financial transactions
                through secure peer-to-peer financial networks from anywhere as long as you have an internet
                connection. DeFi records and verifies financial actions in distributed financial databases which
                collect and aggregate data from all users and use a consensus mechanism to verify the data.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

